    "note": "Eidolon ladder is cumulative: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'You Ask Why Hearts Cry' = ally DoT x1.16 (hys_e1 boost:dot 0.16) + a coexisting second DoT instance on Talent inflict. E2 'Tell Me Why Waves Roar High' spreads the Fiddle of Pearls DMG Boost to all allies while the Zone is active (hys_fiddle2) — unobservable here because the fixture's Hysilens has EHR below the Fiddle threshold, pinned by a custom placeholder. E3 raises Maelstrom Rhapsody 2 -> 2.16, Aeolian Mode 0.5 -> 0.55 and Zone DEF down 0.25 -> 0.27 (Ult+2 / Basic+1). E4 'Lo, How Time Flows By' = Zone All-Type RES -20% (hys_e4 resAll -0.2). E5 raises Overtone Hum 1.4 -> 1.54, skill vuln 0.2 -> 0.22 and Talent DoT 418 -> 459 (Skill+2 / Talent+2). E6 'When to Return From Where You Lie' = Zone Phys DoT cap 12 and multiplier x1.2 (observed Bleed base 1470 -> 1764). Fixtures run one battle per rank e0..e6; each requirement pins the ranks where its effect must be present or absent."
